# THE AUTHORITY for the pristine arm of the scored ratio, and the one thing in this task the agent
# cannot reach: tests/ is uploaded at verify time, AFTER the agent's turn, while the tree this seals
# sits at a path the agent owns for the whole turn.
#
# THE HOLE THIS CLOSES. tests/test.sh resolves the scored PRISTINE arm from `source_dir` in
# ${workspace}/real_engine_source.json. That file is written pre-agent and then sits in the agent's
# own workspace; the trial runs as ROOT, so both it and the tree it names (/app/baseline_repo) are writable
# for the whole turn. Editing that tree does not need the JSON touched at all, and it moves the
# DENOMINATOR of the ratio being scored -- a slower baseline is the cheapest way to pass a speedup
# gate without repairing anything.
#
# FORMAT: `<sha256>  <*.py count>`, both compared. A digest that matches while the count does not
# means the seal's two fields disagree with each other, which must not read as a verified tree.
#
# DERIVED FROM A TREE A REAL TRIAL STAGED -- this task's own tests/test.sh staging path,
# 2517 regular non-symlink *.py under /app/baseline_repo.
# NOT derived from upstream: a sibling task did that and was void from the day it merged, its seal
# covering 2006 *.py against a staged 2004.
#
# TO RE-DERIVE: run this task's tests/_pristine_digest.py over the tree test.sh stages, inside a
# trial on this task's own image. Any other tree is a different number.
#
# THE CHANNEL THIS DOES NOT COVER, recorded so it is not mistaken for covered: the content digest
# skips symlinks, and the staging overlay links the compiled half of the engine in with `ln -sfn`
# (25 links here). A path ABSENT from the pinned tree lands as a symlink that moves neither
# this digest nor this count -- `_version.py` and a root `sitecustomize.py` are the two live shapes,
# the second because CPython's site.py imports it by itself when the arm's tree is first on
# PYTHONPATH. The inventory IS computed and recorded (`symlink_digest` in
# artifacts/raw/pristine_tree_check.json); the value observed when this seal was taken was
#     738ef5a9543c44d7ba2af8c6fc7c46943b36ae8988f0ce53e582cdcacbb5a251  25
# and it is NOT sealed here, because it has one sample where this digest has 99. It is recorded on
# every run; a second agreeing sample is what would turn it into a seal.
